201 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 185 0 R
/E (Students often struggle to absorb fast\055paced lectures while simultaneously taking comprehensive notes\056 Traditional note\055taking can result in missed information\054 while existing AI tools may require expensive subscriptions or offer limited customization\056 To address this gap\054 VoiceNoteX transcribes lectures in real time and generates structured\054 personalized notes tailored to individual learning needs\056 Students can review transcripts\054 refine notes\054 and ask questions to improve understanding\056 By combining speech recognition with generative AI\054 VoiceNoteX reduces the burden of manual note\055taking and provides an organized\054 personalized\054 and effective learning experience\056)
/Pg 3 0 R
/K [ 41 ]
>>
endobj
